один раз на запрос, после слота перепроверяется только input.\n.ai-team/runs/agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029/teamlead/package.md:291:- `fingerprints/coder-after.json` (`1729033c…`, files=168)\n.ai-team/runs/agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029/teamlead/package.md:296:- server.py: `_classify_part` (text None/'' + посторонние ключи -> unknown); `do_POST`: `_universal_render_messages` безусловно при universal, `full_prompt = stripped` при `force_cold or (universal and not images)`.\n.ai-team/runs/agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029/teamlead/package.md:298:- VER-001/002/003/004/006/007/008/009 exit 0; fingerprint sha256 0efcb715f698e2d4ce3c6b08f6f4a48113e02e7790d16ac74575f82c24175ed5.\n.ai-team/runs/agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029/teamlead/package.md:325:  When `universal=True` and `_media_part_counts(messages) == (0, 0)`, `do_POST` (`bridges/agy-bridge/server.py:4116,4154,4201`) leaves `render_messages = messages` (raw input) instead of `_universal_render_messages(messages)`, so `full_prompt = _messages_to_prompt(render_messages, images)` calls legacy `_flatten_content`, which executes `return str(content)` on any `dict`-content (`{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"hello\", \"payload\": {\"data\": \"PAYLOAD_SECRET_12345\"}}}`). That serializes the entire dictionary (including unenumerated `data`/`payload`/`source`/`attachment` keys) into the CLI prompt. Additionally, `{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": None, \"payload\": S}` was classified as `\"text\"` because `_classify_part` allowed `text is None`.\n.ai-team/runs/agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029/teamlead/package.md:328:  2. In `_classify_part`, require `isinstance(text, str)` (never `text is None`) and if `text == \"\"` with extra keys outside `{\"type\", \"text\"}`, classify as `\"unknown\"` so `{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": None, \"payload\": S}` and `{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"\", \"payload\": S}` count as `other_media=1` and render `[media omitted]`.\n.ai-te